{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">佐敦有危險棚架，消防到場拆除。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">凌晨零時許警方接報指，柯士甸道105號一樓外牆有棚架搖搖欲墜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SCAFFOLDING-0200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026PykYMXT0aj1787608771.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SCAFFOLDING-0200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防員到場封鎖一段行車路，架起雲梯，將該幅1.5米乘0.5米的棚架拆除。現場消息指棚架於昨日早上搭建，作為更換冷氣機用途。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T22:19:47.597932+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}